  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">Podpora komunitn&#xfd;ch aktiv&#xed;t kliniky 2</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support of community activities of the clinic 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;Preparation of leisure activities for children attending the clinic, teaching different skills in a creative workshop, teaching English and physical education at a nearby elementary school. Help with PR activities, photo-documentation and fundraising of the clinic, etc. If necessary, the volunteer will help with small administration, social research for a local social worker, or the foundation and administration of a local children&apos;s library.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SK">&lt;p&gt;Pr&#xed;prava vo&#x13e;no&#x10d;asov&#xfd;ch aktiv&#xed;t pre deti nav&#x161;tevuj&#xfa;ce kliniku, vyu&#x10d;ovanie r&#xf4;znym zru&#x10d;nostiam v kreat&#xed;vnej dielni, dou&#x10d;ovanie anglick&#xe9;ho jazyka a telesnej v&#xfd;chovy na bl&#xed;zkej z&#xe1;kladnej &#x161;kole. V&#xfd;pomoc pri PR aktivit&#xe1;ch, fotodokument&#xe1;cii a fundraisingu kliniky a pod. V pr&#xed;pade potreby bude dobrovo&#x13e;n&#xed;&#x10d;ka vypom&#xe1;ha&#x165; s drobnou administrat&#xed;vou, soci&#xe1;lnym v&#xfd;skumom lok&#xe1;lnemu soci&#xe1;lnemu pracovn&#xed;kovi &#x10d;i zakladan&#xed; a spr&#xe1;ve miestnej detskej kni&#x17e;nice.&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
  <participating-org ref="XM-DAC-69-2" role="2" type="10">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">eRko - Hnutie kres&#x165;ansk&#xfd;ch spolo&#x10d;enstiev det&#xed;</narrative>
